</math> is a positive constant, and <math alttext="g left parenthesis 3 right parenthesis equals 2,375"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2,375</mn></math>. It follows that when <math alttext="x equals 3"><mrow>
	<mi>x</mi>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>3</mn>
</mrow>
</math>, <math alttext="g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 2,375"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2,375</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext="3"><mn>3</mn>
