enthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}],"keys":["b1cbbf41-6113-48bb-8f29-2369b3c6ef02"],"correct_answer":["D"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. The <em>y</em>-intercept of a graph in the <em>xy</em>-plane is the point at which the graph crosses the <em>y</em>-axis. The graph shown crosses the <em>y</em>-axis at the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 8 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Therefore, the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph shown is&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 8 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":"manifold","position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1691007959827,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"f547a8b1","skill_cd":"P.C.","score_band_range_cd":2,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","createDate":1691007959827,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":null,"external_id":"2deb518b-5f4a-45ec-828f-20051b7eb7aa","primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"755aff3e-0d65-4b84-b433-6c6b6d074c3a","difficulty":"E"},"raw_detail":{"keys":["b1cbbf41-6113-48bb-8f29-2369b3c6ef02"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. The <em>y</em>-intercept of a graph in the <em>xy</em>-plane is the point at which the graph crosses the <em>y</em>-axis. The graph shown crosses the <em>y</em>-axis at the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 8 right parenthesis\"><