	<mi>c</mi>
</mrow>
</math> for some constant <math alttext="c"><mi>c</mi>
</math> intersects a parabola at exactly one point. If the parabola has equation <math alttext="y equals minus 2 x squared plus 9 x"><mrow>
	<mi>y</mi>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mrow>
