ifth left parenthesis x plus 19 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 35 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>55</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> yields <math alttext=\"0 equals minus one fifty fifth left parenthesis x plus 19 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 35 right parenthesis\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>55</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Multiplying both sides of this equation by <math alttext=\"negative 55\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>55</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"0 equals left parenthesis x plus 19 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 35 right parenthesis\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Since a product of two factors is equal to <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> if and only if at least one of the factors is <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math>, either <math alttext=\"x plus 19 equals 0\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>19</mn>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> or <math alttext=\"x minus 35 equals 0\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>35</mn>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"19\"><mn>19</mn>\n</math> from both sides of the equation <math alttext=\"x plus 19 equals 0\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>19</mn>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"x equals negative 19\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>19</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Adding <math alttext=\"35\"><mn>35</mn>\n</math> to both sides of the equation <math alttext=\"x minus 35 equals 0\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>35</mn>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"x equals 35\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>35</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Since <math alttext=\"x greater than 0\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, <math alttext=\"35\"><mn>35</mn>\n</math> minutes after collecting the sample the submersible device reached the surface of the ocean.</p>","externalid":"6233db14-f861-4237-b90c-a47a7b724601","answerOptions":[],"correct_answer":["35"]},"createDate":1743430554983,"updateDate":1743430554983}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1743430554983, 1743430554983),
    ($SATQ$f76c1858$SATQ$, $SATQ$692774ab-373f-4544-a043-aea38e8b5f3f$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.B.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Nonlinear equations in one variable and systems of equations in two variables $SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 5, $SATQ$spr$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: center;"><math alttext="7 x squared minus 20 x minus 32 equals 0"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mrow>
			<mn>7</mn>
			<msup>
				<mi>x</mi>
				<mn>2</mn>
			</msup>
		</mrow>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mrow>
			<mn>20</mn>
			<mi>x</mi>
		</mrow>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mn>32</mn>
	</mrow>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>0</mn>
</mrow>
</math></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">What is the positive solution to the given equation?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["4"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["4"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>The correct answer is <math alttext="4"><mn>4</mn>
</math>. The left-hand side of the given equation can be factored as <math alttext="left parenthesis 7 x plus 8 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Therefore, the given equation, <math alttext="7 x squared minus 20 x minus 32 equals 0"><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, can be written as <math alttext="left parenthesis 7 x plus 8 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis equals 0"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Applying the zero product property to this equation yields <math alttext="7 x plus 8 equals 0"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mrow>
			<mn>7</mn>
			<mi>x</mi>
		</mrow>
		<mo>+</mo>
		<mn>8</mn>
	</mrow>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>0</mn>
</mrow>
</math> and <math alttext="x minus 4 equals 0"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mi>x</mi>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mn>4</mn>
	</mrow>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>0</mn>
</mrow>
</math>. Subtracting <math alttext="8"><mn>8</mn>
</math> from both sides of the equation <math alttext="7 x plus 8 equals 0"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mrow>
			<mn>7</mn>
			<mi>x</mi>
		</mrow>
		<mo>+</mo>
		<mn>8</mn>
	</mrow>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>0</mn>
</mrow>
</math> yields <math alttext="7 x equals negative 8"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mn>7</mn>
		<mi>x</mi>
	</mrow>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mn>8</mn>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>. Dividing both sides of this equation by <math alttext="7"><mn>7</mn>
</math> yields <math alttext="x equals negative eight sevenths"><mrow>
	<mi>x</mi>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mfrac>
			<mn>8</mn>
			<mn>7</mn>
		</mfrac>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>. Adding <math alttext="4"><mn>4</mn>
</math> to both sides of the equation <math alttext="x minus 4 equals 0"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mi>x</mi>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mn>4</mn>
	</mrow>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>0</mn>
</mrow>
</math> yields <math alttext="x equals 4"><mrow>
	<mi>x</mi>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>4</mn>
</mrow>
</math>. Therefore, the two solutions to the given equation, <math alttext="7 x squared minus 20 x minus 32 equals 0"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mrow>
			<mn>7</mn>
			<msup>
				<mi>x</mi>
				<mn>2</mn>
			</msup>
		</mrow>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mrow>
			<mn>20</mn>
			<mi>x</mi>
		</mrow>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mn>32</mn>
	</mrow>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>0</mn>
</mrow>
</math>, are <math alttext="negative eight sevenths"><mrow>
	<mo>-</mo>
	<mfrac>
		<mn>8</mn>
		<mn>7</mn>
	</mfrac>
</mrow>
</math> and <math alttext="4"><mn>4</mn>
</math>. It follows that <math alttext="4"><mn>4</mn>
</math> is the positive solution to the given equation.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"f76c1858","external_id":"692774ab-373f-4544-a043-aea38e8b5f3f","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"ce659395-9863-4632-9370-2967cd2d8a79","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"P","domain":"Advanced Math","skill_cd":"P.B.","skill_desc":"Nonlinear equations in one variable and systems of equations in two variables ","difficulty":"M","score_band_range_cd":5,"type":"spr","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"7 x squared minus 20 x minus 32 equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t</msup>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>20</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>32</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the positive solution to the given equation?</p>","answerOptions":[],"keys":["4"],"correct_answer":["4"],"rationale":"<p>The correct answer is <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math>. The left-hand side of the given equation can be factored as <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 7 x plus 8 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Therefore, the given equation, <math alttext=\"7 x squared minus 20 x minus 32 equals 0\"><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, can be written as <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 7 x plus 8 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis equals 0\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><